{"slug":"commited_main_30f39fa67d21125cff7671fbcfc9dfd833567068","contributor":"Indrajeety993648","activity_definition":"commited","title":"Pushed commit to main","occurred_at":"2024-08-19T11:09:30.000Z","link":"https://github.com/ohcnetwork/leaderboard/commit/30f39fa67d21125cff7671fbcfc9dfd833567068","text":"Added hover Effect in Google Summer of Code label (#501)\n\n### Add Hover Effect to Google Summer of Code Label\r\n\r\n## Fixes Issue : #487\r\n- Added a hover effect to the \"Google Summer of Code\" label.\r\n- On hover, the background color changes to yellow and the text color turns white.\r\n\r\n**Details:**\r\n\r\n- Updated the `ACTIVE_PROJECT_LABELS` configuration with a new `className` to include the hover effect.\r\n- Utilized Tailwind CSS utility classes: `hover:bg-yellow-500`, `hover:text-white`.\r\n\r\n**Before:**\r\n- The label had a static background and text color.\r\n\r\n**After:**\r\n- The background now turns yellow and the text color changes to white on hover.","points":2,"meta":{"branch":"main","stats":null}}
